\vspace*{0.5cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterSea} 「下去」四次，「安排」四次}\\[0.1cm]
{\normalsize Four Descents, Four Appointments}

\vspace{0.6cm}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  % left column: Jonah goes down (ירד)
  \node[font=\small\bfseries,text=ChapterSea] at (-3.6,4.6) {約拿下去 \ \textit{Jonah goes down}};
  \node[draw=ChapterSea,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=4.6cm,minimum height=0.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (d1) at (-3.6,3.4) {1:3 \ 下到約帕 \ \textit{Joppa}};
  \node[draw=ChapterSea,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=4.6cm,minimum height=0.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (d2) at (-3.6,2.0) {1:3 \ 下到船裏 \ \textit{the ship}};
  \node[draw=ChapterSea,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=4.6cm,minimum height=0.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (d3) at (-3.6,0.6) {1:5 \ 下到底艙 \ \textit{the hold}};
  \node[draw=ChapterSea,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=4.6cm,minimum height=0.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (d4) at (-3.6,-0.8) {2:6 \ 下到山根 \ \textit{roots of the mountains}};
  \draw[->,color=ChapterSea,thick] (d1) -- (d2);
  \draw[->,color=ChapterSea,thick] (d2) -- (d3);
  \draw[->,color=ChapterSea,thick] (d3) -- (d4);

  % right column: the LORD appoints (מנה)
  \node[font=\small\bfseries,text=ScriptureGold] at (3.6,4.6) {神安排 \ \textit{The LORD appoints}};
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=4.6cm,minimum height=0.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (a1) at (3.6,3.4) {1:17 \ 一條大魚 \ \textit{a great fish}};
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=4.6cm,minimum height=0.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (a2) at (3.6,2.0) {4:6 \ 一棵蓖麻 \ \textit{a plant}};
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=4.6cm,minimum height=0.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (a3) at (3.6,0.6) {4:7 \ 一條蟲子 \ \textit{a worm}};
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=4.6cm,minimum height=0.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (a4) at (3.6,-0.8) {4:8 \ 炎熱的東風 \ \textit{a scorching east wind}};
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (a1) -- (a2);
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (a2) -- (a3);
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (a3) -- (a4);

  % the pair that the book ends on
  \node[draw=ChapterSea,fill=white,rounded corners,minimum width=9.6cm,minimum height=0.9cm,font=\small\bfseries,text=ChapterSea,align=center] at (0,-2.4) {4:11 \ 我豈能不愛惜呢？ \ \textit{Should I not have compassion?}};
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.8cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
約拿四次「下去」，都在離開差他的那位；神四次「安排」——魚、蓖麻、蟲、東風——每一次都把約拿拉回到祂要問他的地方。書的最後一句話不是約拿的回答，是神的問句。
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.5cm}
{\footnotesize\color{LightGray} 「何況這尼尼微大城……我豈能不愛惜呢？」— 約拿書 4:11}
\end{center}
